repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-rom-image-python
url: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-rom-image-python
abstract: >-
  A model of the forms a Super Nintendo cartridge image is stored and shipped in: the registration area a cartridge carries, the size and chipset bytes a header declares, and the checksum rule that holds them together. Every field is settled against Nintendo's own development manual and measured across a retail library rather than against its author's confidence.
keywords:
  - snes
  - super-nintendo
  - rom-image
  - cartridge
  - checksum
  - hardware-model
  - conformance
